HubSpot Sales skills, version 2.3.0

The SKILL.md files in the sibling folders, and the two helper files in _helpers/, are HubSpot's
"HubSpot Sales" Claude plugin, copied unmodified from
https://github.com/HubSpot/hubspot-mcp-plugins (path HubSpot-Sales, commit a0c5960, 2026-09-11).
They are licensed under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE in this folder. The rest of
hubspot-mcp is MIT licensed.

hubspot-mcp serves these files to MCP clients through hubspot_load_skill and load_skill. It
changes nothing in them. It prepends a runtime header that maps the HubSpot connector tool names
the skills use onto this server's tools and explains this server's write gate. HubSpot does not
endorse or maintain this server.
